WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.520
Come in!

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.810
Sister, it's time to go to—

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.280
Wh-What is all this?

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.320
Prince Geordo has been
sending me presents every day.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.710
I have to wonder... why me?

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.170
Are you talking about Prince Geordo?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.340
Yeah.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:01.520
I'm totally normal and not
interesting at all. So why me?

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:07.470
You should try looking up
"normal" in a dictionary sometime.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.560
Good morning, Catarina.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.170
G-Good morning, Prince Geordo.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.420
Did the presents I sent
you arrive without issues?

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:17.580
Y-Yes!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:21.200
You're getting too close.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.620
Keith, Catarina and I are
going to get married someday.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.790
We could, and should,
be getting even closer.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.170
How can you talk about marrying
her? She's afraid of you!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.420
Catarina isn't afraid of me.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.190
She's just grown more aware of me.

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:40.560
Unlike someone else here,
whom she has no awareness of at all.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:47.350
Lady Catarina, good morning!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.260
Oh, good morning!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:53.530
Oh, Prince Geordo.
Are you sure you should be here?

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.810
I thought you had lots
of student council work piling up.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:01.750
Now that you mention it, I do
suddenly have a lot more work of late.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.740
It's almost as if someone
is intentionally dumping work on me

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:08.030
in an attempt to take up more of my time.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.130
I-I don't know anything about it.

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:14.500
Perhaps your exhaustion
has made you paranoid?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.430
Well, no matter how much work I have,

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.880
it won't cause all
that much hardship for me.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:23.140
How remarkable you are, Prince Geordo.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.640
Everyone!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.850
We must hurry, or we'll be late!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.930
Let's go, Lady Catarina!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.720
Okay!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.060
I'm exhausted.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:40.340
You do seem to be overwhelmed lately.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.900
Have some of these, Sister.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.320
Thanks...

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.620
I don't know if I'm overwhelmed...

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.590
I'm just not used to all this,

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:51.740
so Prince Geordo's aggressive
approach makes me nervous.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:56.200
We're on break starting tomorrow,
so let's go back home and relax.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.960
Yeah, good idea.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.590
Keith is such a nice boy!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:05.890
When my older brothers in my
previous life wanted to cheer me up,

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.030
they'd use professional
wrestling moves on me.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:12.060
By the way, have you decided
what you'll do after graduation?

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.730
Huh? No, not yet.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.520
If you want to join the Department of Magic,

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.510
Lady Larna will write you
a letter of recommendation, right?

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.890
Yeah, but I'm having
trouble making up my mind.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.740
I just don't feel confident
that I could get by there.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.120
I have some of the weakest
magic in the whole academy,

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.190
and my grades aren't that great, either.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:34.010
Joining the most important
organization in the country

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.720
through my connections just seems wrong.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.850
I see.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.330
Well, you can take your
time thinking about it.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.140
Yeah.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.450
Wow, these sweets are tasty, too!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.470
Hey...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.270
What?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:57.280
Do you really have no interest
in marrying Prince Geordo?

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.770
Of course not!

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.070
I mean, if I did, I'd be royalty!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.940
You really think I could pull that off?

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.050
It might be difficult for you.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.380
Right?

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.130
Still...

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:14.410
Still, if you do see Prince Geordo as...

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.970
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.010
Heave-ho and here we go!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.480
Heave-ho and here we go!

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:34.010
With Catarina back home,
the whole mansion...

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.940
Heave-ho and here we go!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.500
no, the whole world just
feels so much brighter.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.980
Heave-ho and here we go!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:43.700
Working the fields really
is the best way to relax.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.520
I was able to harvest a lot,

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.200
and I got the fields cleaned up.
Everything looks great!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.010
Oh, I know! I should show Keith!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.000
Keith!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.740
I guess he's not back from shopping yet?

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.480
G-Good day, Mother...

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.250
Catarina. Come to my room for a moment.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.240
Oh, no!

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:30.160
I can't believe she
lectured me for so long...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.860
I should go vent to Keith.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:37.130
Keith, open up. It's me.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:42.020
Keith?

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:47.520
Keith never did come home that day.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.220
What could have happened to Master Keith?

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:56.090
This has never happened before.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.310
Lady Catarina, please wake up!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.550
Lady Catarina!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:01.090
Huh?

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:04.030
Morning, Anne. Where's Keith?

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.570
We must go see your mother
about that at once!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.850
Huh?

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.240
Catarina, read this.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:12.650
A letter?

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.960
"I can't endure the obligations
of being the duke's successor any longer,

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:22.350
so I'm running away from home.
Please don't search for me. -Keith."

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.740
What is this?!

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.580
It just arrived moments ago.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.600
I can't believe Keith would run away!

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:31.550
But this is definitely Keith's handwriting.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.930
I couldn't believe it, either,

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.590
so I asked the servants
all kinds of questions,

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:41.560
and they said he seemed very glum
and depressed recently.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:43.610
Keith? Depressed?

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.200
Yes, and they said
that when he feels that way,

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:49.450
it's almost always right after
he's talked to a certain someone.

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.110
A certain someone?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.900
Mother, who could that be?

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.360
Well, it's...

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.870
you, Catarina!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.590
What?! Me?!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:05.190
Yes, you, Catarina!

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:07.080
According to the servants,

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:11.470
Keith has recently seemed particularly
depressed after talking to you!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.140
Now that you mention it...

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.020
So you do see it!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:25.400
Keith ran away because babysitting
you became a burden to him!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.230
Huh? Babysitting me?

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:33.130
Looking after such a hopeless older sister
for all these years exhausted him.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:37.720
But since he's such a kind boy,
he couldn't come out and say he resented you,

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.160
so he wrote that letter...

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.530
Wh-What should I do?

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:46.090
There's no changing what's been done.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:50.070
The first thing you must do
is apologize for everything.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.320
Then, you must do your best
to avoid troubling him ever again.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:55.300
If you can convey your intentions sincerely,

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.520
I'm sure he'll forgive you.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:59.470
M-Mother...

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.140
I will apologize sincerely to Keith!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:06.250
And I'll let him know that I'll try my best
to avoid troubling him ever again!

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.910
Good. Give it your best effort, Catarina!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:13.610
We will now begin this strategy meeting.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:14.940
We don't need a strategy.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:17.630
We just need to apologize to Keith
for everything, right?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:22.160
That is true, but I think we need
to show more sincerity.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:25.450
How about giving him a present?
Maybe some sweets?

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.970
Or new seedlings, or some fertilizer
for the fields might be nice!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.960
Those are things Catarina would want!

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.550
So, where <i>is</i> Keith?

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:37.180
The first thing we need
to do is find him, no?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.550
L-Leave it to you to realize that.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:42.860
We'll have to go out
on a journey to find Keith...

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:46.330
So instead of that famous story "In Search
of Mother," it's "In Search of Brother"!

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:51.430
Then, do we agree that we must
first go on a journey to find Keith?

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.070
No objections!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.590
I'll go with you.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.690
Huh?!

00:09:58.520 --> 00:09:59.770
Oh, yeah.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:03.150
Prince Geordo and Keith
were good friends as kids.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.640
He must be worried about him.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:08.280
Keith is clever, so I doubt
we need to worry about him,

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:12.000
but it's too dangerous for you
to go on a journey by yourself.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.210
Oh...

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:17.640
Incidentally, Lady Catarina,
where do you intend to start searching?

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.940
Huh? Uh...

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.480
Are you telling me you
hadn't even thought about it?!

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.270
You were preparing
for your journey with such zeal

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.220
that I was sure you had a plan!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.610
Wh-What should I do?

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:33.190
If that's the case, I have an idea.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.650
Keith ran away?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:36.670
Yes...

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.740
We can't even begin
to guess where he might have gone,

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.480
so we came to ask for your help.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:43.250
So that's it.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.200
In that case, I have just the thing.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.630
A teddy bear?

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.420
Not just any teddy bear.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:54.200
It's a magic tool.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.040
It's not another one
with a shady history, is it?

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:01.760
Don't worry. I developed this one myself.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.570
You did?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:07.130
A certain perver—

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:10.100
I mean, a certain person of high
standing asked me to make it.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.680
It's a magic tool that can find people.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:15.150
It can find people?

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.280
That's right.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.740
It can track a person using
one of their possessions.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.850
The more that possession means to them,

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:24.720
the more accurately it can
pinpoint their location.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.580
I-It... seems to be moving...

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.920
It wouldn't be very useful if it
couldn't lead you to the target, would it?

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.010
What? The teddy bear leads you
to where the person is?

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.150
That's right.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.840
Um... Why a teddy bear, though?

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.930
Well, it's adorable, isn't it?

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.680
I found it at a general store in town
and instantly fell in love.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.630
C-Cute? Is it really?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:50.470
Okay, I'll go back home
and get something of Keith's.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.870
Do that.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:55.080
Also, I'll be accompanying
you on your journey.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.570
What?! You, too?!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.820
When you're searching for someone,
the more people you have, the better.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:06.790
We really shouldn't open this
without Master Keith's permission,

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:09.720
but since it's an emergency,
we have no choice.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:13.240
Thanks. I'll apologize to Keith later.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:18.210
What are these?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.170
They're the birthday
presents I've given him!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:25.270
Wow! He even has things
I gave him years ago!

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.980
An "I'll do any one thing you ask" coupon?

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:29.880
When did I give him this?

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.380
You gave that to Master Keith as an apology

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:37.600
after you fell out of a tree
and landed on him.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:45.100
Now that I think about it,
I've only ever caused trouble for him...

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.290
I'll find Keith, whatever it takes.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.970
I have to apologize to him
for everything I've done!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.300
Hi there, Lady Catarina Claes!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.800
H-Hello, Prince Jeffrey.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.000
Why are you at the Department of Magic?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.560
Actually, I asked Larna
to make a magic tool for me.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:10.850
I came to see how it turned out.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.420
The item he requested was one
that could locate people.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:15.610
You mean...

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:19.060
That's right. The one you're
about to use on your journey.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:23.040
What?! Are you sure we can use it
before Prince Jeffrey?

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:25.310
Oh, I don't mind.

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.730
You can use it first to confirm
that it actually works.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:30.920
Thank you so much!

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:35.750
Oh, um... What did you plan
to use a tool that finds people for?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.580
Well, I always want to know
where my precious little ones are.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.540
Y-Your precious little ones?

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:46.890
Yes! I want to know where the most important
people in the world are at all times!

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:50.390
Is this for some important
state mission or something?

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.800
It has nothing to do with that.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.110
I want to use it for personal reasons.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.830
Huh? What does that mean?
Is he talking about stal—

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.100
No, just stop. Don't put
too much thought into it.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.370
Anyway, what are these?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.780
They're presents I gave to Keith.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.620
I guess he valued them enough
to keep them all this time.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.060
I see.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.060
All right, I'll just borrow one.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.040
And how do we use that to find Keith?

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.490
Just watch.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:27.820
Huh?! It's like a dog getting a scent...

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:34.590
Good boy, Alexander. Now, where is Keith?

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.830
Huh? Alexander?

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.400
That's his name.
Rather debonair, don't you think?

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.730
S-Sure...

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.740
Wow, Alexander! Excellent!

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:02.650
Keep your wits about you, Catarina.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.280
Listen well to what Lady Larna says.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.250
I will.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:10.420
Are you sure I shouldn't
accompany you, Lady Catarina?

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:13.050
I'll be fine. Even Maria's coming with me.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.620
You can count on me
to take care of Lady Catarina.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:18.270
I promise I'll find Master Keith, as well.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.870
Thanks, Maria!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.550
Still, where in the world
could Master Keith have gone?

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.800
Yes, I'm very worried.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.560
I wish I could go
with you to search for him.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.900
This just wasn't the time.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.330
We can't lose the entire
student council at once.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.100
I'm sure Keith will be fine, though.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.440
Maybe he just wanted to
spread his wings a bit.

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:43.840
Every man has times
when he just wants to be alone.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:48.540
I will protect you no matter
what happens, Catarina.

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:50.460
Okay...

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:54.140
Uh... Your reaction seems
to have gone back to normal...

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.930
Looks like she's forgotten
what happened with you.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:16:00.440
She's probably too preoccupied
with her concern for Keith right now.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.010
I didn't realize it had
gotten to this stage...

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:03.950
Huh?

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.720
Nothing at all!

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:08.660
Don't give it a second
thought, Lady Catarina!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:11.360
Thanks for waiting, Lady Catarina.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.320
Oh, Master Sora. Thank you
for joining us on this trip.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:19.150
Same to you. I'm honored to travel
with you, Prince Geordo.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.920
Please feel free to call me "Sora."

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.040
Well, let's get going.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:26.970
Right!

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:40.040
Where are you, Keith?

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:09.930
We couldn't get any information at all.

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:12.420
We've only just begun searching.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.300
Don't look so glum.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:18.640
Besides, Alexander says
we're still a ways off.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.340
Seriously, this bear...!

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:37.800
Delicious!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.990
What is it?

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.620
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.200
It's just so entertaining to watch
your expressions change so quickly.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:46.660
Oh...

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:50.440
Being with you is always great fun.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:54.380
I can see why all of those
kids need you so much.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.680
They need me?

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.000
In other words...

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.110
I think you are to them what magic is to me.

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:05.690
Magic is my everything.
It brings color to my world.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:07.230
Magic does that?

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:11.600
Yes. Long ago, when I was very young,

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.910
I was horribly bored with the world.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.880
I could do almost anything with ease,

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.730
so I never found anything fun.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.070
I was such an unlovable child.

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:28.080
But one day, a friend gave me
an entire collection of books about magic.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.860
They weren't books meant
for a child to read,

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.460
but after just a quick
perusal, I was hooked.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.860
By the time I'd finished
reading the entire collection,

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:40.740
I had grown completely obsessed with magic.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.270
And since I possessed magic myself,

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:46.970
I tried out various things,
which hooked me even further.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.600
You're only the second
person I've told about this.

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.570
What? Really?

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.160
Yes. I've only told you and my partner.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.170
Your partner?

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.020
My fiancé.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:01.480
What is he like?

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.840
He's a weirdo.

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.790
Oh, now that you mention it,

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.900
Geordo once said he was
the same way as a child.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:12.120
That he could do everything
and couldn't really get into anything.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:17.210
That must mean he's managed to find
something that he's truly into now.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.180
What does that mean?

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:23.390
Nothing is ever going to
come of this, is it?

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:26.350
Lady Catarina!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:29.290
How'd it go? Did you find anything out?

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.850
No. How about you?

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.770
No leads here, either.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.500
Where could he be?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:39.410
If he just ran away, I wouldn't
think he'd have gone too far...

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.280
I agree.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.210
Come on, back to the carriage.

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.330
Okay!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.770
I hope this will make Sister feel better.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.080
Keith.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.310
Who might you be?

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.350
Oh, my! Who am I, you ask?

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.790
You make it sound as if I'm a stranger.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.080
Why are you...

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:29.930
Listen, I have a favor to ask.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.930
You'll hear me out, won't you?

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:38.330
I don't remember anything after that.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.950
She was a horrible woman to begin with.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:45.600
I knew that, and yet...

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.770
Long time no see.

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.380
Why aren't you saying anything?!

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:07.870
What, you don't speak
to lower-ranked nobles?!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:13.330
Just get out of here, mistress's child!

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:15.790
Thomas?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.760
Address me with respect!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.650
How dare you take that attitude
toward your older brother?!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.490
You think you can address me
by my first name alone?!

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.610
What gives a little
worm like you the right?!

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:47.320
Sis...ter...
